   "from": "latin",
   "convention": "This writes modern spelling letter by letter in the Elder Futhark. It is the site’s convention, not an ancient practice: the carvers spelled by sound in their own languages, never by English letters, and a real inscription of an English word would look different. The folds below are applied in the order given, and every one used is reported under the result.",
